        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our policies prohibit transactions with SDNs, and we maintain a risk-based compliance program designed to prevent unlawful business dealings with prohibited countries, regions, individuals or entities.",
        "start_character": 40145,
        "end_character": 40346
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in two reportable business segments: Bitcoin Mining and Engineering.",
        "start_character": 594,
        "end_character": 673
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we anticipate that bitcoin mining and data center development will continue to be areas of focus for regulators in the near- and long-term due to the rapid growth of digital assets and high-performance computing, we cannot predict with certainty the impact that future regulations, policy developments, or enforcement actions may have on our business or operations.",
        "start_character": 33603,
        "end_character": 33974
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we will monitor potential regulatory developments affecting data centers more broadly and their affiliated energy use.",
        "start_character": 41747,
        "end_character": 41878
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we expand our operations to include the development and operation of large-scale data centers, we also face significant competition from established data center operators and infrastructure providers.",
        "start_character": 13771,
        "end_character": 13974
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By securing ownership of the underlying real estate, we have eliminated leasehold contingencies, thereby facilitating the further development and expansion of the Rockdale Facility for large-scale data center operations.",
        "start_character": 3390,
        "end_character": 3610
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we have developed and may continue to develop certain proprietary software and hardware applications to enhance our Bitcoin Mining operations, including technologies used in our immersion-cooled mining systems.",
        "start_character": 56690,
        "end_character": 56913
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Howell has also served as Chief Executive Officer at ESS Metron, LLC (“ESS Metron”), a subsidiary of the Company and a leading manufacturer of power distribution centers,",
        "start_character": 62116,
        "end_character": 62286
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2022, we initiated development of the Corsicana Facility to expand our Bitcoin Mining capabilities.",
        "start_character": 30165,
        "end_character": 30267
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we announced the process of developing a scalable data center platform to support non-mining data center operations, including potential applications in AI and HPC.",
        "start_character": 41573,
        "end_character": 41746
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to recruiting top external talent, we offer management and executive training programs and encourage continuous professional development across the Company.",
        "start_character": 47566,
        "end_character": 47734
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022322",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022322-f452387f7c3f17f6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022322",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In exchange for solving a block, we receive a bitcoin reward, which we may either hold or sell on the market to generate cash to fund operations.",
        "start_character": 54266,
        "end_character": 54411
      }
